            + "   * vocabulary nothing else in this system speaks. `packages/tty`'s line discipline consumes bytes,\n"
            + "   * because a terminal is a byte stream, so a page built on key names could not reach it — and\n"
            + "   * design/0001 step 5 wants one discipline for the ssh channel and the browser's keydown loop both.\n"
            + "   * Translating at the edge, in `host/entryBrowser.ts`, is what lets everything above it be bytes.\n"
            + "   *\n"
