            + " * did not choose and usually wants — to echo it, to derive an output name from it, or to decide\n"
            + " * what it is.\n"
            + " */\n"
            + "/**\n"
            + " * What a child program wrote, once it has finished.\n"
            + " *\n"
            + " * Both streams, because a shell needs them apart: a program's diagnostics go to the terminal\n"
            + " * even when its output is piped into the next stage, and one buffer cannot say which was which.\n"
            + " */\n"
            + "export struct Captured {\n"
            + "  u8[] out;\n"
            + "  u8[] err;\n"
            + "  /**\n"
            + "   * Whether `out` is **all** of what the child wrote, or as much as would fit.\n"
